{"symbol":"PROTEAN","yahoo":"PROTEAN.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE004A01022","name":"Protean eGov Technologies Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.proteantech.in","about":"Protean eGov Technologies Limited, together with its subsidiaries, develops and implements citizen-centric and population-scale e-governance solutions and digital public infrastructure in India. It offers PAN and tax deduction, and collection account number issuance; electronic tax deducted at source return processing; online PAN verification; digital enrolment, Electronic National Pension System, and D-Remit; and digital permanent retirement account number generation and integrated payment solutions. The company also provides digital identity services, such as authentication, verification and paperless transactions; and identity solutions, including Aadhaar authentication, e-KYC services, licensed eSign services, and online PAN verification. In addition, it offers Open Network for Digital Commerce, a BECKN gateway and registry; Central AgriStack for data exchange of farmers, government bodies, and private entities; Vidhyasaarthi and ONEST for education and skilling; CMIS and PHR applications, as well as centralized dashboards for the health sector; and technology platform for a digital insurance marketplace. Further, the company provides Protean On-Premises Cloud, an open-source cloud platform; Managed Security Operations Centre for security monitoring and incident management services; Quantum-Safe Data Vault for privacy sensitive information; Secure API Gateway, an API integration platform; AI in a Box, a modular AI platform; analytics as a service; and Data Stack Portfolio comprising RISE with Protean, eSignPro, Account Aggregator, and AI-driven CKYC and Onboarding. Additionally, it is involved in the development of interoperable digital platforms; the operation of a network of PAN and TIN facilitation centres. The company was formerly known as NSDL e-Governance Infrastructure Limited and changed its name to Protean eGov Technologies Limited in October 2021. Protean eGov Technologies Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:29:33+00:00","quote":{"price":690.7,"prevClose":641.95,"marketCap":2816.62,"high52":909.5,"low52":444.0,"pe":34.04,"bookValue":265.61,"dividendRate":10.0,"roe":null,"shares":4.0779,"insiders":23.83,"institutions":8.76},"prices":{"dates":["2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","2025-05-07","2025-05-08","2025-05-09","2025-05-12","2025-05-13","2025-05-14","2025-05-15","2025-05-16","2025-05-19","2025-05-20","2025-05-21","2025-05-22","2025-05-23","2025-05-26","2025-05-27","2025-05-28","2025-05-29","2025-05-30","2025-06-02","2025-06-03","2025-06-04","2025-06-05","2025-06-06","2025-06-09","2025-06-10","2025-06-11","2025-06-12","2025-06-13","2025-06-16","2025-06-17","2025-06-18","2025-06-19","2025-06-20","2025-06-23","2025-06-24","2025-06-25","2025-06-26","2025-06-27","2025-06-30","2025-07-01","2025-07-02","2025-07-03","2025-07-04","2025-07-07","2025-07-08","2025-07-09","2025-07-10","2025-07-11","2025-07-14","2025-07-15","2025-07-16","2025-07-17","2025-07-18","2025-07-21","2025-07-22","2025-07-23","2025-07-24","2025-07-25","2025-07-28","202